ing family's)"] [346 43 "// PY6c"] [409 5 "// traceback objects are PY5b's (a Traceback is not an Object yet)"] [458 2 "// the hooks and introspection the stdlib reads at import (PY6a: threading, test.support)"] [506 1 "// displayHook is sys.displayhook: None prints nothing; another value's repr is written to sys.stdout and"] [507 1 "// bound to builtins._ (the REPL's expression statements)."] [524 1 "// sysAttr is sys.NAME when the sys module exists and has it, else nil."] [532 1 "// writeTo writes s to a file object: the interpreter's stdout when f is nil or None, a textFile directly,"] [533 1 "// else f.write(s)."] [554 1 "// exactArgsN checks a function's call: n positional arguments, no keywords (CPython's messages)."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[101 53] [119 30] [180 48] [246 13] [246 26] [332 20] [371 62] [377 62] [391 26] [398 54] [401 26] [407 26] [408 38] [419 51] [422 29] [428 56] [434 43] [437 46] [449 7] [449 30] [463 35] [517 63] [526 48] [542 28]]} (go/file "sys.go" :imports [


